        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እግዚአብሔርንም ፡ ያመሰግኑ ፡ ነበር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወቦሙ ፡ ሞገስ ፡ በኀበ ፡ ኵሉ ፡ ሕዝብ ፡⟫",
