          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "chapter_title",
          "text": "ምዕራፍ ፡ ፫ ፡ ክፍል ፡ ፩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": "፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፩ ፤ ⟪ወዐርጉ ፡ ምኵራበ ፡ ጴጥሮስ ፡ ወዮሐንስ ፡ ጊዜ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተስዓት ፡ ለጸሎት ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false,
          "stage1_text": "ተሰዓት ፡ ለጸሎት ።⟫",
          "stage2_correction": {
            "pair": "ተሰዓት -> ተስዓት",
            "reason": "The printed glyph has the 6th-order (ሳድስ) top-left bend of ስ, matching the canonical Ge'ez feminine ordinal/hour form ጊዜ ተስዓት (the ninth hour)."
          },
          "uncertain": []
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዕለቱን ፡ ነው ፡ ቢሉ ፡ በነጋውም ፡ ቢሉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሳምንቱም ፡ ቢሉ ፡ ጴጥሮስና ፡ ዮሐንስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዘጠኝ ፡ ሰዓት፡ ሊጸልዩ፡ ወደ ፡ ምኵራቡ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገቡ ፡ (ጥቅ) ፡ ወዓርጉ ፡ ቤተ ፡ እዎን ፡ ክል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኤቱ ፡ ዕደው ፡ ዓርጉ ፡ ቤተ ፡ መቅደስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዲል ። አንድም ፡ እርከን ፡ እርከን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያለው ፡ ነውና ፡ ወደ ፡ ምኵራቡ ፡ ወጡ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጌታ ፡ በተሰቀለ ፡ ጊዜ ፡ አድሮባት ፡ የነ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በረ ፡ መንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡ በነጭ ፡ ርግብ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አምሳል ፡ ተለይቶ ፡ ወጥቶ ፡ ሲሄድ ፡ ታይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቷል ፡ ከዚያ ፡ በኋላ ፡ እንደ ፡ ገበያ ፡ እንደ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በረት ፡ ሆነች ፡ ይላል ፡ ምን ፡ ብለው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይጸልዩባታል ፡ ቢሉ ፡ ጴጥሮስና ፡ ዮሐ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንስ ፡ ምኵራበ ፡ ወንጌል ፡ ብለው ፡ ይጸ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልዩባታል ፡ እንጅ ፡ ምኵራበ ፡ ኦሪት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብለው ፡ ይጸልዩባታልን ፡ ያውስ ፡ ቢሆን፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጸሊ ፡ በኅቡዕ ፡ ይል ፡ የለም ፡ ቢሉ ፡ ለሰ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ው ፡ አብነት ፡ የማይሆኑበትን ፡ ተሠው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ረው ፡ ይሠሩታል ፡ ለሰው ፡ አብነት ፡ የሚ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሆኑበትን ፡ ገልጠው ፡ ይሠሩታልና ፡ ይህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግን፡ ለሰው፡ አብነት፡ የሚሆኑበት፡ነውና።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": "፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፪ ፤ ⟪ወሀሎ ፡ ብእሲ ፡ ዘፅዉስ ፡ እገሪሁ ፡ ተወልደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከማሁ ፡ እምከርሠ ፡ እሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከናቱ ፡ ማኅፀን ፡ ጀምሮ ፡ ልምሾ ፡ ሁኖ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የተወለደ ፡ አንድ ፡ ሰው ፡ ነበረ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይጸውርዎ ፡ ኵሎ ፡ ዕለተ ፡ ወያነብርዎ ፡ በኖኅተ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምኵራብ ፡ እንተ ፡ ስማ ፡ አርያ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዕለት ፡ ዕለት ፡ እየተሸከሙ ፡ እየወሰዱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አርያ ፡ በምትባል ፡ በምኵራብ ፡ ደጅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይጥሉት ፡ ነበር ፡ አርያን ፡ ለምኵራብ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቢቀጥሉ ፡ እድምተ ፡ ስን ፡ ሠናይተ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሱራሬ፡ ማለት፡ ነው፡ ለኖኅት ፡ ቢቀጥሉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የብርሃነ፡ ፀሐይ፡ መግቢያ ፡ ማለት ፡ ነው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ከመ ፡ ይስአል ፡ ምጽዋተ ፡ እምኀበ ፡ እለ ፡ ይበውኡ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምኵራበ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወደ ፡ ምኵራቡ ፡ ከሚገቡት ፡ ሰዎች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምጽዋት ፡ ይለምን፡ ዘንድ ፡ ያስቀምጡት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነበር ፡ ም ፡ ፲፬ ፥ ፰ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": "፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፫ ፤ ⟪ወርእዮሙ ፡ ለጴጥሮስ ፡ ወለዮሐንስ ፡ ይበ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውኡ ፡ ምኵራበ ፡ ወሰአሎሙ ፡ የሀብዎ ፡ ምጽዋተ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጴጥሮስንና ፡ ዮሐንስን ፡ ወደ ፡ ምኵራብ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሲገቡ ፡ ባያቸው ፡ ጊዜ ፡ ምጽዋት ፡ ምጽ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዋት ፡ ብሎ ፡ ለመናቸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወተመይጥዎ ፡ ጴጥሮስ ፡ ወዮሐንስ ፡ ኀቤሁ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የምጽዋት ፡ ነገር ፡ ያለው ፡ ይሰጣል ፡ የሌ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለው ፡ ተበድሬ ፡ ተቀድሜ ፡ ልስጥ ፡ አይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልምና ፡ አልፈው ፡ ከሄዱ ፡ በኋላ ፡ ተመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልሰው ። አንድም ፡ ምጽዋት ፡ ምጽዋት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሎ፡ ሲለምን ፡ ዝም ፡ ብሎ ፡ መሄድ፡ አይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገባምና ፡ ከዚያ ፡ ተመልሰው ። አንድም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለተግባረ ፡ ነፍስ ፡ ይፋጠኑ ፡ ነበርና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዚያ ፡ ደርሰው፡ ተመልሰው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይቤልዎ ፡ ተመየጥ ፡ መንገሌነ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተመየጥ ፡ መንገሌነ ፡ አሉት ፡ እሱም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የከተማ ፡ ለማኝ ፡ ፈሊጠኛ ፡ ነው ፡ የሚ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መጣውን ፡ ይመለከታል ፡ እንጅ ፡ ያለፈ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውን ፡ አይዘበዝብምና ፡ የሚመጣውን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለመመልከት ፡ ፊቱን ፡ መልሶ ፡ ሳለ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
